\ **************************************************************************
\ *
\ *     pad.6502 - Phase 0: the harness image at its largest (PLAN.md 2.3)
\ *
\ **************************************************************************
\
\ Fill the rest of the harness image, up to the screens, with a pattern
\ unlike zeros, so the S0 check proves the largest image loads and copies
\ down intact. Later phases drop this as real code takes the space.

\ Once S0 has checked it, the pad is the host's I/O area: io_area up to
\ CODE_GUARD (S4's pools).

.pad
.io_area
FOR i = P% ..< CODE_GUARD
    EQUB (i * 37 + (i DIV 256) * 11 + 5) AND 255
NEXT
